  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.3.9 (editor layout): the field-configuration dialog gives its space to the settings instead of reserving it. The live preview moves from a column of its own (38 percent of the dialog, holding one input) to a full-width strip above the tabs, where it still stays visible while you switch tabs, and the settings take the whole width in two columns: General 584 px tall becomes 544, Validation 474 becomes 352. Field width is one list again (1 to 4 columns, or Full width) instead of a switch that greyed out a separate dropdown plus a line of help text; it writes the same two model properties, so saved forms are unaffected. The state toggles read down a single column, ordered Required, Read-only, Disabled, then Clearable. The full history ships in the package as CHANGELOG.md.",
